4. g3 $2 { Blocks the check, but the pawn on e4 is now unprotected and the rook on h1 sits on the same diagonal behind it. } 4... Qxe4+ { Check again. It also attacks the rook on h1 behind the e4 pawn. } 5. Qe2 Qxh1 *
